WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.312 --> 00:00:19.313
Bobby wiped the sweat off his forehead.

2
00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:23.116
It was only nine o'clock, but it was already hot.

3
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:25.018
He didn't mind.

4
00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.900
Today was Three-Legged Race Day!

5
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.782
The Kids Central campers were having three-legged races this morning.

6
00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:36.344
They were taking turns being partners with each other.

7
00:00:37.765 --> 00:00:41.146
At the end of the day, they'd see which team ran fastest.

8
00:00:42.227 --> 00:00:43.988
That team would win the blue ribbon!

9
00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:50.391
The five campers gathered on the soccer field.

10
00:00:50.411 --> 00:00:54.974
"Please choose a partner for your first race," Mr.

11
00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:55.734
Dunn called.

12
00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:58.496
"Want to be partners?"

13
00:00:58.940 --> 00:00:59.960
Ethan asked Bobby.

14
00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.741
"Sure!" said Bobby.

15
00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.722
He knew Ethan would be a fast partner.

16
00:01:07.923 --> 00:01:11.243
Bobby and Ethan tied their inside legs together with a scarf.

17
00:01:12.264 --> 00:01:13.884
"Practice walking first.

18
00:01:15.225 --> 00:01:16.685
Then try running," Mr.

19
00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:17.645
Dunn suggested.

20
00:01:18.765 --> 00:01:22.406
Bobby was a little taller than Ethan, but it was easy to walk together.

21
00:01:24.027 --> 00:01:25.047
"Ready?" Mr.

22
00:01:25.087 --> 00:01:25.747
Dunn asked.

23
00:01:26.748 --> 00:01:27.768
The kids lined up.

24
00:01:29.152 --> 00:01:31.733
Bobby and Ethan were racing against Nina and Izzie.

25
00:01:31.753 --> 00:01:35.874
"On your mark, get set, go!"

26
00:01:39.815 --> 00:01:41.455
two. One, two.

27
00:01:41.975 --> 00:01:46.317
One, two," Bobby and Ethan chanted as they easily ran ahead of the girls.

28
00:01:46.337 --> 00:01:53.579
"With a time of 32 seconds, the winners are Bobby and Ethan!"

29
00:01:54.039 --> 00:01:55.059
Mr. Dunn called.

30
00:01:56.959 --> 00:01:58.880
Next Bobby teamed up with Jason.

31
00:01:59.788 --> 00:02:01.630
They raced against Nina and Ethan.

32
00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.932
But Bobby and Jason tripped a lot.

33
00:02:06.173 --> 00:02:11.378
"With a time of 34 seconds, the winners are Nina and Ethan!"

34
00:02:11.818 --> 00:02:12.919
Mr. Dunn announced.

35
00:02:14.681 --> 00:02:17.583
In the third race, Bobby was partners with Nina.

36
00:02:18.524 --> 00:02:20.185
But she was a lot shorter than him.

37
00:02:21.146 --> 00:02:22.447
And they couldn't stop falling!

38
00:02:27.956 --> 00:02:33.120
"With a time of 36 seconds, the winners are Jason and Izzie!

39
00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:37.363
There are just two more races.

40
00:02:38.423 --> 00:02:42.206
Can anyone beat Bobby and Ethan's record of 32 seconds?"

41
00:02:42.606 --> 00:02:44.388
Mr. Dunn challenged the campers.

42
00:02:44.408 --> 00:02:48.110
"I bet I can," Izzie said.

43
00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.572
"Let's be partners!"

44
00:02:50.992 --> 00:02:52.133
Bobby said to Izzie.

45
00:02:54.335 --> 00:02:56.156
They quickly tied their legs together.

46
00:02:57.504 --> 00:03:01.006
"We can beat you," said Ethan, who was paired up with Jason.

47
00:03:01.026 --> 00:03:03.787
"Jason and I are almost the same height.

48
00:03:04.787 --> 00:03:05.988
So we're going to be fast."

49
00:03:07.488 --> 00:03:09.289
Ethan was right about being fast.

50
00:03:10.389 --> 00:03:11.250
As soon as Mr.

51
00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.450
Dunn said "Go!"

52
00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.151
the two boys shot ahead.

53
00:03:14.171 --> 00:03:17.592
"One, two.

54
00:03:18.273 --> 00:03:19.033
One, two.

55
00:03:19.653 --> 00:03:20.374
One, two.

56
00:03:20.914 --> 00:03:23.295
One, two," Izzie and Bobby grunted.

57
00:03:24.315 --> 00:03:25.856
They went faster and faster.

58
00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:30.394
Izzie and Bobby fell down just as they crossed the finish line.

59
00:03:30.414 --> 00:03:37.239
"With a time of 31 seconds, Izzie and Bobby have become the fastest pair!"

60
00:03:37.639 --> 00:03:38.700
Mr. Dunn cried.

61
00:03:39.701 --> 00:03:42.783
Bobby wiped grass off his T-shirt and grinned at Izzie.

62
00:03:42.803 --> 00:03:46.886
"Only one more race to go.

63
00:03:47.986 --> 00:03:52.269
Nina and Jason versus Izzie and Ethan," said Mr.

64
00:03:52.329 --> 00:03:55.612
Dunn. "Oh no.

65
00:03:56.444 --> 00:03:57.745
I still have another race!"

66
00:03:58.205 --> 00:04:00.127
Izzie said, trying to catch her breath.

67
00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:04.410
Bobby watched nervously as the racers lined up.

68
00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:08.572
"On your mark, get set, go!"

69
00:04:09.113 --> 00:04:10.174
Mr. Dunn called.

70
00:04:13.416 --> 00:04:16.958
Nina and Jason stumbled while Izzie and Ethan zoomed ahead.

71
00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.882
Were they fast enough to beat Bobby and Izzie's time?

72
00:04:21.902 --> 00:04:28.230
"With a time of 32 seconds, Izzie and Ethan do not beat the record.

73
00:04:29.391 --> 00:04:32.013
The winners are Izzie and Bobby!"

74
00:04:32.593 --> 00:04:33.694
Mr. Dunn announced.

75
00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:39.579
"You are the fastest girl I know," Bobby said.

76
00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.800
Izzie grinned.

77
00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:46.044
"Thanks. Now let's race to get our blue ribbons!"
